   const owns=id==='l-w-course-t29'?["Clouds block our view of the Moon, so we should record the observation conditions.", "A blocked view is not proof that the Moon disappeared.", "We record the time, the Moon’s visible shape and the clouds without inventing missing observations."]:(id==='l-s-course-t29'?["A blocked view alone does not prove that the Moon disappeared.", "We should record the time, the Moon’s visible shape and any clouds blocking our view.", "A blocked view is not proof that the Moon disappeared. We should describe the observation conditions."]:(id==='l-w-course-t28'?["This notice is about a planned safety exercise, not a live warning.", "We should listen to the teacher before beginning the session.", "We should check the current plan and agreed signal instead of inventing the arrangements."]:(id==='l-s-course-t28'?["This notice is about a planned safety exercise, not a live warning.", "Could you explain the current plan and our agreed signal before we begin?", "We should listen to the teacher before the exercise starts and check anything we do not understand."]:(id==='l-w-course-t27'?["Our notes cover one short path during three afternoons.", "This record covers the same path during those three afternoons.", "These notes are useful, but they do not represent the whole town for the entire year."]:(id==='l-s-course-t27'?["We observed visible litter on one short path during three afternoons.", "These notes can help us ask questions about that particular path.", "They do not represent the whole town for the entire year."]:(id==='l-w-course-t26'?["We will watch quietly from the marked path and use the viewing area.", "If a photograph is unclear, we will not move close to a nest.", "If a photograph is unclear, we will keep watching without disturbing the birds."]:(id==='l-s-course-t26'?["We will watch quietly from the marked path and use the viewing area.", "If our photograph is unclear, we will not move close to a nest or disturb the birds.", "We will stay quiet in the viewing area while observing the birds."]:(id==='l-w-course-t25'?["The woodland path has steps, while the river path is flatter.", "We should check current conditions and the group’s needs before choosing.", "Neither route is suitable for every group in every situation."]:(id==='l-s-course-t25'?["The river path is flatter, while the woodland path has steps.", "We should check today’s opening conditions and ask about the group’s needs.", "We cannot choose one route for everyone from the terrain description alone."]:(id==='l-w-course-t24'?["Our paper-bridge project compares two folded designs under the same classroom conditions.", "We keep the classroom conditions the same while comparing the two folded designs.", "This is a model for investigation, not a claim that paper can replace a real road bridge."]:(id==='l-s-course-t24'?["We will compare two folded paper-bridge designs under the same classroom conditions.", "It is a classroom model, and its results cannot establish that paper can replace real road bridges."]:(id==='l-w-course-t23'?["I would check two kinds of information: the original image details and the current local context.", "I would check current local information because a genuine old image may not show what is happening here today.", "I would name the checks without claiming that the image is fake or that the sender deliberately lied."]:(id==='l-s-course-t23'?["Before forwarding the photograph, I would check its original source and date.", "I would also check current local information, because a genuine old image may not show what is happening here today.", "I would check both kinds of information before deciding whether to forward it, without assuming that the sender deliberately lied."]:(id==='l-w-course-t22'?["In my invented example, a drawing of a river path reminds me of walks with my grandfather.", "That connection makes the place feel like home to me.", "Other people may connect with the same town in different ways."]:(id==='l-s-course-t22'?["A drawing of a river path is an ordinary object I can use in an invented personal example.", "The drawing reminds me of walks with my grandfather.", "That connection makes the place feel like home to me, while other people may connect differently."]:(id==='l-w-course-t21'?["Permission for a private class chat does not automatically cover a public page.", "We need to explain the public use and ask the people shown for consent before sharing.", "Sending a request does not mean consent for this public use has already been confirmed."]:(id==='l-s-course-t21'?["Before sharing the class photograph publicly, we need to explain where it will appear and ask the people shown.", "Permission for a private class chat does not automatically cover a public page.", "We still need to confirm consent for this public use rather than assume everyone has already agreed."]:(id==='l-w-course-t20'?["In this fictional profile, Rao records where each photograph came from.", "She checks dates against records before adding the photographs to the display.", "Her careful work helps visitors understand the photographs without inventing dramatic stories."]:(id==='l-s-course-t20'?["In this fictional profile, Rao records where each photograph came from and checks its date.", "She checks the dates against records before adding the photographs to the display.", "Her careful work helps visitors understand the photographs without inventing dramatic stories."]:(id==='l-w-course-t19'?["In this invented family, we keep a paper decoration after a celebration.", "It reminds us of the time we spent making it together.", "This is one family example, and other families may have different customs."]:(id==='l-s-course-t19'?["In this invented family, we keep a small paper decoration after a celebration.", "It reminds us of the time we spent making it together.", "This is one family example, and other families may have different customs."]:(id==='l-w-course-t18'?["Ella seems honest because she admits that the kite is not finished.", "She tells the truth instead of pretending that the kite is ready.", "Her message gives her cousin a chance to suggest finishing it together."]:(id==='l-s-course-t18'?["The kite is not finished, and Ella tells her cousin the truth.", "Ella seems honest because she does not pretend that the kite is ready.", "Her message gives her cousin a chance to suggest finishing it together."]:(id==='l-w-course-t17'?["Each team has four players, and all four must touch the ball before the team scores.", "The team can score only after everyone has touched the ball.", "The rule encourages passing and participation but does not guarantee equal individual scores."]:(id==='l-s-course-t17'?["Each team has four players, and everyone must touch the ball before the team scores.", "Meeting this touch condition does not guarantee a score or identical points for everyone.", "The rule encourages passing and gives everyone a chance to take part."]:(id==='l-w-course-t16'?["I can see an empty chair beside a bright window and open space near the door.", "To me, the scene feels quiet, and I can also write that I find the scene quiet.", "This is my own interpretation rather than verified information about the artist’s life."]:(id==='l-s-course-t16'?["I can see an empty chair beside a bright window and open floor space near the door.", "To me, the scene feels quiet, but that is my interpretation.", "These visible details do not prove anything about the artist’s personal history."]:(id==='l-w-course-t15'?["Would you like to share a story about a dish your family enjoys?", "You do not need to bring food, and you need not speak for a whole country.", "Your own experience is enough, so please tell us about your family."]:(id==='l-s-course-t15'?["Would you like to share a story about a dish your family enjoys?", "You do not need to bring food or speak for a whole country.", "I can ask when your family usually makes the dish, without assuming everyone does the same."]:(id==='l-w-course-t14'?["People used to store tools here, and the room is now used to display neighborhood photographs.", "I can explain past use, present use and then a careful view of change.", "The display may help people compare changes, but not every change is an improvement."]:(id==='l-s-course-t14'?["The fictional station room stored tools in the past and now displays neighbourhood photographs.", "The room used to store tools, but it is now used to display neighbourhood photographs.", "This fictional display can help people compare changes, but not every change is an improvement."]:(id==='l-w-course-t13'?["My partner will ask the makers for permission before we include their work.", "I will check the guide’s wording, while my partner will ask the makers for permission.", "Both jobs matter because a clear guide should also respect the people whose work it describes."]:(id==='l-s-course-t13'?["I will check the guide’s wording, and my partner will ask the makers for permission.", "My partner will ask what use the maker permits, rather than assume a request means consent.", "Both jobs matter because the guide should be clear and respect the makers."]:(id==='l-w-course-t12'?["The event begins at ten on Sunday, but volunteers should arrive at nine forty-five.", "We need the introduction in order to understand our roles before the event begins.", "We should arrive fifteen minutes before the event so that we can hear the introduction."]:(id==='l-s-course-t12'?["The event begins at ten on Sunday, but volunteers should arrive at nine forty-five.", "We should arrive first and listen to the introduction so we understand our roles before the event.", "A quarter to ten is fifteen minutes before ten, but the introduction length is not given."]:(id==='l-w-course-t11'?["I will wash the vegetables on Monday, and my brother will set the table.", "If I am unable to do my part, I will tell the family in advance.", "I will let the family know before the work needs to begin."]:(id==='l-s-course-t11'?["I will wash the vegetables, and my brother will set the table.", "These are our two different jobs for Monday, not a record of finished work.", "If I cannot do my part, I will tell the family before the work begins."]:(id==='l-w-course-t10'?["I thought you were angry with me when you left the game.", "Now I understand that you had to pick up your younger sister.", "I should have asked you first instead of guessing your reason."]:(id==='l-s-course-t10'?["The picture shows him leaving, but it does not prove that he was angry.", "I thought you did not want to play, but you needed to pick up your younger sister.", "I should have asked you first instead of deciding what you meant."]:(id==='l-w-course-t09'?["Our labels keep falling off, but we have not checked the cause.", "We should record which corners or edges come loose before blaming the tape.", "First we can observe the loose edges, record what happens and discuss possible causes."]:(id==='l-s-course-t09'?["The left example shows a corner lifting, but it does not explain the cause.", "Our labels keep falling off, but we have not checked the cause yet.", "We should record which corners come loose before blaming the tape."]:(id==='l-w-course-t08'?["The three-pack costs five yuan per notebook but fifteen yuan in total.", "I will buy the six-yuan notebook because I have twelve yuan and need only one.", "The single notebook meets today’s need, and I will have six yuan left."]:(id==='l-s-course-t08'?["The three-pack costs five yuan per notebook but fifteen yuan in total.", "I have twelve yuan, so I am three yuan short of the pack price.", "I need only one notebook today, so I will buy the six-yuan one."]:(id==='l-w-course-t07'?["After watering, I will wipe the shelf and return the bottle.", "I still need to clean up before the next person uses the corner.", "Leaving the corner ready for the next person is part of the task."]:(id==='l-s-course-t07'?["The middle picture shows wiping, and the right picture shows putting the bottle away.", "I will wipe the shelf and return the bottle after watering.", "These actions leave the corner ready for the next person to use."]:(id==='l-w-course-t06'?["She is responsible for checking the stage props before the show.", "She also prepares the objects on the list and returns them afterwards.", "Her backstage work helps the actors have the props they need."]:(id==='l-s-course-t06'?["She looks at the stage props and talks with another person.", "She prepares the props on the list and returns them after the show.", "She works behind the scenes and helps the performance run smoothly."]:(id==='l-w-course-t05'?["My bag is untidy today, but I can work on one part.", "I can begin by putting the papers I need tomorrow together in one pocket.", "This one small change does not require me to fix every problem at once."]:(id==='l-s-course-t05'?["My bag is untidy today, but I can learn a better way to organise it.", "The picture shows some materials together in the front pocket.", "I can begin by putting the papers I need tomorrow together in one pocket."]:(id==='l-w-course-t04'?["I will close my notes before I try the five words.", "I will check the notes after trying to write the words from memory.", "Copying with the answers visible does not show what I can recall on my own."]:(id==='l-s-course-t04'?["I will close my notes and try to recall the five words.", "First I will try from memory, and then I will check my notes.", "Copying with the list open cannot show what I remember without looking."]:(id==='l-w-course-t03'?["I feel worried about speaking in front of my class.", "Could I speak to you in private after the lesson, please?", "I would like your help deciding how to start my talk."]:(id==='l-s-course-t03'?["I am worried about speaking in front of my class.", "Could I talk to you privately after the lesson, please?", "Could you help me work out how to begin?"]:(id==='l-w-course-t02'?["We meet by the green gate at four on Tuesday.", "Before you use any tools, please listen carefully to the teacher’s instructions.", "I will check that my sentences give the correct meeting details and keep listening before tool use."]:(id==='l-s-course-t02'?["Our garden club meets by the green gate at four on Tuesday.", "Please listen to the teacher’s instructions before using any of the tools."]:(id==='l-w-course-t01'?["On Wednesday I have basketball practice after school.", "I will read on the journey home, so I do not have to give up my reading time.", "Because practice takes part of my afternoon, I need to move reading to another part of the day."]:(id==='l-s-course-t01'?["I have basketball practice after school on Wednesday.", "I will read during the journey home instead of giving up my reading time.", "This change lets me keep both practice and reading in my Wednesday plan."]:(id==='l-w-note'?["Hi Ben, would you like to visit the park with me this Saturday?", "We can meet at the school gate at ten in the morning.", "Please remember to bring a bottle of water for our trip.", "I will keep the note between thirty-five and fifty words and use a fictional sender name."]:(id==='l-s-read-aloud'?["I will keep half past four together and read the library door clearly.", "I will practise the question in meaningful groups without leaving out any words.", "After reading both roles aloud, I will listen for missed words and repeat unclear phrases."]:(id==='l-s-problem'?["I borrowed the book on Monday and noticed the missing pages while reading this afternoon.", "Without those pages, I cannot understand how the experiment ends. I do not know who caused the damage.", "Could I exchange this book for another copy, please? I would like to finish reading the explanation."]:(id==='l-s-opinion'?["I would explain my view with two reasons and a practical way for everyone to join in.", "I favour rotating speakers because it offers practice and brings different ideas to the discussion.", "Each member could prepare one point and help the next speaker rehearse before presenting."]:(id==='l-s-compare'?["The school is about three kilometres away. Cycling gives me exercise, while the bus can be useful in bad weather.", "Today I would take the bus because rain is expected.", "On a dry day I might cycle, so my choice depends on the conditions."]:(id==='l-s-plan'?["Could we meet in the classroom at three this Sunday afternoon?", "I can bring some pictures, and you could bring paper and pens.", "I can write the captions while you arrange the pictures.", "What do you think, and is there anything you would like to change?"]:(id==='l-s-retell'?["On Saturday my friend and I noticed litter beside a park bench, decided to help and sorted it, before a visitor joined us.", "I felt encouraged because another person wanted to help us."]:(id==='l-s-introduce'?["I enjoy growing herbs in small pots.", "I check the soil each morning and water the plants when needed.", "I like seeing new leaves grow and using the herbs in our meals."]:(id==='l-w-report'?["During the lunch break, we found two taps that were not fully turned off. The notice near the library entrance was hard to see, and classmates were willing to take turns checking.", "We could put a clearer notice where students can see it and arrange checks by willing volunteers.", "We observed taps left partly on; we are proposing volunteer checks for the future."]:(id==='l-w-opinion'?["I support setting aside fifteen minutes for free reading each day.", "A regular time can build a habit, and choosing books can make reading enjoyable.", "We should check the timetable and review a short trial before making a lasting change."]:(id==='l-w-story'?["After class, a student dropped a pencil case beside my desk.", "I stopped and helped pick up the pencils.", "The student smiled, and I felt glad that I had stopped."]:(id==='l-w-notice'?["Join us at the school gate this Saturday from nine to eleven in the morning.", "Every student in our school is welcome to join.", "Bring a book you have read and choose another at the exchange table.", "Please leave books with torn covers or pages at home."]:(id==='l-w-advice'?["Try reviewing four words and reading one short paragraph each day.", "Using the words in sentences helps you understand their meaning.", "Take one small step today and keep practising patiently."]:["We will meet in the library at 4 p.m. this Friday.", "Would you like to share your favourite book at our reading club?", "Please tell me whether you can join us."]))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))));
